title: "Computation Atlas"
abstract: >-
  A static, client-side map of cellular-automaton rule space, paired with an offline pipeline that
  measures every life-like rule and reports budget-capped outcomes as undecided rather than
  guessing. Every product records its rule, seed, budgets and version hash.
